{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061567/block/singleImage/3255454/df/01M6DJ1A3BM3ZCG5077KC7NM10.jpg?updatedAt=1793604078\"/><figcaption>18歲男遭「入境處」指控傳虛假訊息，為證清白被呃60萬元。(Runway 1331)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (2 日 ) 中午 12 時 55 分，一名 18 歲男生在啟德承豐道 1331 號青年旅舍報案，指自己早前接獲一名「入境處職員」來電，指他發出虛假訊息，要求轉帳以自證清白，結果男生先後轉帳共 64 萬元予對方指定戶口，對方其後失聯，事主懷疑受騙於是報案，案件列作「詐騙」跟進調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:41:35.752324+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:21:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:18:11.953241+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:38:35.386765+00:00","content_hash":"9428ca995fa0efefbbaa58e08e7630a789d9dff05a1a0f39b5bd2f35b9b961c4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:41:35.752324+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}